              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "OSV.dev lists RUSTSEC-2023-0089 for crates.io package atomic-polyfill at version 1.0.3 as informational (unmaintained): atomic-polyfill is unmaintained. It reports no vulnerability; an unmaintained package will not receive fixes for future ones. Plan a move to a maintained alternative, or record the decision to keep it. Advisory data comes from OSV.dev at the recorded time."
              },
